# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# hostapd 2.12 build configuration for the baseline rootfs (revision 8; common/recipes/userspace.sh
# build_hostapd). The box's own access point: AP mode over nl80211 (mwifiex on the IW416 unit), WPA2-PSK
# (CCMP), internal crypto, the UNIX control socket. Nothing else: no RADIUS / 802.1X / EAP server, no VLAN,
# no accounting, no D-Bus, no WPS.
# Provenance: the .config of the static hostapd built on 2026-10-30 that ran `AP-ENABLED` on mlan0 of the
# IW416 unit (README §7.0c step 7), unchanged. The keys hostapd 2.12 no longer reads (CONFIG_IEEE80211N is
# always on since 2.10; CONFIG_INTERNAL_* follow CONFIG_TLS=internal) are kept so the file stays that one.
# What the RUNTIME configuration must carry, learned on that unit: country_code, ieee80211n=1,
# wmm_enabled=1 and a non-empty wpa_passphrase, or hostapd fails to initialize the interface.
CONFIG_DRIVER_NL80211=y
CONFIG_LIBNL32=y
CONFIG_IEEE80211N=y
CONFIG_NO_VLAN=y
CONFIG_NO_ACCOUNTING=y
CONFIG_NO_RADIUS=y
CONFIG_NO_CTRL_IFACE_DBUS=y
CONFIG_TLS=internal
CONFIG_INTERNAL_LIBTOMMATH=y
CONFIG_INTERNAL_AES=y
CONFIG_INTERNAL_SHA1=y
CONFIG_INTERNAL_SHA256=y
CONFIG_INTERNAL_MD5=y
CONFIG_INTERNAL_RC4=y
CONFIG_CTRL_IFACE=unix
CONFIG_NO_RANDOM_POOL=y
